   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Push th' Little Daises**: back after 59 archived shows (643 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Mango Woman**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2023-08-04.AKG461** (recommended): source not stated; 37 songs; 166 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Track 12 opens with an extended Claude drum solo; nearby crowd calls for a medic for a possibly collapsed fan [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2023-08-04.AKG461**: taped by kcmoejoe; transferred by kcmoejoe; source: JW Mod AKG 461's > Sound Devices MP-2 > Roland R05 (24/48) [1]. Also: Mics sat center, behind the board, about 10 feet away; transferred via Wavelab 6.0 to WAV, then 16-bit FLAC [1]",
